ction of the twitter and instagram  posts  one twitter user wrote i honestly forgot  you were gonna be in she-hulk so i had a  second time of feeling shocked and happy  about it  another wrote in part you and tatiana  maslany together  in the same show dara even dream the  same scene occasionally that's going to  be mint  it'd be downright rude not to watch that  over on jamil's instagram her celebrity  friends were just as supportive as her  fan base  liza koshy commented on jamil's set  video with an excited  hell's yes congratulations to dope queen  star phoebe robinson said  can't wait to see you kick butt one of  jamil's instagram followers also  commented on the video sharing an app  sentiment  the shiro we've been waiting for with  jamil's video now circulating around the  internet it feels like the door is open  for other she-hulk cast and crew to  share photos or videos from sets as they  prepare to shoot the new disney plus  show  time to start crossing those hulk-sized  fingers she-hulk fans  if you aren't sure who jamila jamil is  you've probably been living under a rock  as this british actress and comedian  star has been seriously on the rise  since 2017  after working as a british television  presenter jamil learned that acclaimed  showrunner michael shurer was  specifically looking for a brit to round  out the cast of his newest series  and ultimately jamil scored her first  ever acting role as well-connected  socialite tahani al-jamil  on sure's beloved afterlife series the  good place after playing tahani for all  four seasons of the good place jamil  picked up several other gigs including  voice work and the ducktales reboot a  hosting job on tbs's game show the  misery index and has helped promote body  awareness with her social media campaign  ai way now with her appearance as  titania and she-hulk jamil's profile is  sure to grow even bigger  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite tv shows and movies are  coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

